<title>NEW ZEALAND: FCL Energy, Forests, Telecom ADRs gain, Dow firms.</title>
<headline>FCL Energy, Forests, Telecom ADRs gain, Dow firms.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>FCL Energy, Forests and</p>
<p>Telecom ADRs gained in late New York trade while the Dow firmed</p>
<p>35.63 points to 7,305.29.</p>
<p>Company	Exchange   Last	  Net change</p>
<p>Tranz Rail     N.Y.    US$17		nil   *</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$27 1/8	 -0 1/2 *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$30 1/8	 +0 3/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$23 3/8	   nil  *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$13 3/8	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$38 1/2	 +0 3/8 *</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.32		 -</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$1.76		 -</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$1.95		 -</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
